  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14190698/assets/8e8f3df43e45dd6916a35c3e9a41fb517f94d32591f656628c5723fd4d0f754d.png)\n\nGiven that $\\overset{―}{CE}$ is a segment, what is the measure of $∠DOC?$\n\n$m∠DOC=$\n{{field-1}}${}^{∘}$",
